{
  "source": "Parsed exactly from straw-hat-still (1).svg's <text> coordinates (24x28 grid, one glyph+colour per cell, centre-anchored 20x20 pitch); the SVG's near-unique per-cell colours were k-means clustered down to 40 (custom JS k-means++, no deps), then every column doubled to correct for the SVG's square cells against this game's ~1.667:1 (tall:wide) character cell — see BIG_FERN's comment in sprites.ts for the same fix. MANUALLY RECOLOURED, carried over from the previous straw-hat-still.svg bake: keys g/h/j are the shirt's blue shading ramp (#7794b0/#9abedc/#c9ddf1, used nowhere else in this sprite — rows 21-23 only) and are white (#e2e2e2/#f0f0f0/#ffffff) instead, per the earlier 'make the shirt white' request.",
